{"seq":4,"slug":"istio-practice","title":"Istio 服务网格实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh/istio-practice","wordCount":1396,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"istio-服务网格实践\">Istio 服务网格实践</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Istio 是当前最流行的开源服务网格（Service Mesh）实现，为微服务架构提供了统一的流量管理、安全通信和可观测性能力。Istio 通过在每个服务实例旁部署 Sidecar 代理（Envoy Proxy），在不修改应用代码的前提下拦截和管理所有网络通信。这种&quot;基础设施层&quot;的抽象将网络关注点从应用代码中剥离，使开发者专注于业务逻辑。</p>\n<p>Istio 的架构分为数据平面和控制平面。数据平面由 Envoy Sidecar 代理组成，负责实际的流量转发、负载均衡、TLS 终止和遥测数据收集。控制平面由 istiod 统一进程提供，整合了 Pilot（流量管理）、Citadel（证书管理）和 Galley（配置验证）的功能。Istio 1.5 之后将三个独立组件合并为 istiod，简化了部署和运维复杂度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 控制平面&#10;        A[istiod] --&gt; B[Pilot]&#10;        A --&gt; C[Citadel]&#10;        A --&gt; D[Galley]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 数据平面&#10;        E[Service A] --- F[Envoy Proxy]&#10;        G[Service B] --- H[Envoy Proxy]&#10;        I[Service C] --- J[Envoy Proxy]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; F&#10;    A --&gt; H&#10;    A --&gt; J&#10;    F &lt;--&gt; H&#10;    H &lt;--&gt; J\">graph TB\n    subgraph 控制平面\n        A[istiod] --&gt; B[Pilot]\n        A --&gt; C[Citadel]\n        A --&gt; D[Galley]\n    end\n    subgraph 数据平面\n        E[Service A] --- F[Envoy Proxy]\n        G[Service B] --- H[Envoy Proxy]\n        I[Service C] --- J[Envoy Proxy]\n    end\n    A --&gt; F\n    A --&gt; H\n    A --&gt; J\n    F &lt;--&gt; H\n    H &lt;--&gt; J</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>关键能力</th>\n<th>资源开销</th>\n<th>替代方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>istiod</td>\n<td>控制平面统一进程</td>\n<td>配置分发/证书签发/服务发现</td>\n<td>1-2 CPU, 2GB RAM</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Envoy Proxy</td>\n<td>Sidecar 数据代理</td>\n<td>流量转发/负载均衡/遥测</td>\n<td>50-100m CPU, 100MB RAM/pod</td>\n<td>Linkerd2-proxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Istio Gateway</td>\n<td>入口网关</td>\n<td>外部流量管理/TLS终止</td>\n<td>独立部署</td>\n<td>Nginx Ingress</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CNI Plugin</td>\n<td>网络配置</td>\n<td>替代 init container 的流量劫持</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"流量管理\">流量管理</h2><p>Istio 的流量管理通过 VirtualService 和 DestinationRule 两个核心 CRD（Custom Resource Definition）实现。VirtualService 定义流量的路由规则——请求如何到达目标服务，DestinationRule 定义到达目标服务后的策略——负载均衡、连接池和断路器。</p>\n<p><strong>金丝雀发布</strong>（Canary Release）是 Istio 流量管理最常用的场景。通过按权重分配流量到不同版本，可以逐步验证新版本的稳定性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: networking.istio.io/v1beta1&#10;kind: VirtualService&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: product-service&#10;spec:&#10;  hosts:&#10;    - product-service&#10;  http:&#10;    - route:&#10;        - destination:&#10;            host: product-service&#10;            subset: v1&#10;          weight: 90&#10;        - destination:&#10;            host: product-service&#10;            subset: v2&#10;          weight: 10&#10;---&#10;apiVersion: networking.istio.io/v1beta1&#10;kind: DestinationRule&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: product-service&#10;spec:&#10;  host: product-service&#10;  trafficPolicy:&#10;    connectionPool:&#10;      tcp:&#10;        maxConnections: 100&#10;      http:&#10;        h2UpgradePolicy: DEFAULT&#10;        http1MaxPendingRequests: 100&#10;        http2MaxRequests: 1000&#10;    outlierDetection:&#10;      consecutive5xxErrors: 5&#10;      interval: 30s&#10;      baseEjectionTime: 30s&#10;      maxEjectionPercent: 50&#10;  subsets:&#10;    - name: v1&#10;      labels:&#10;        version: v1&#10;    - name: v2&#10;      labels:&#10;        version: v2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.istio.io/v1beta1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VirtualService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">product-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  hosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">product-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">destination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">product-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            subset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">destination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">product-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            subset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.istio.io/v1beta1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DestinationRule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">product-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">product-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  trafficPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    connectionPool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      tcp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        maxConnections</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        h2UpgradePolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DEFAULT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        http1MaxPendingRequests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        http2MaxRequests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    outlierDetection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      consecutive5xxErrors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      baseEjectionTime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      maxEjectionPercent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  subsets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v2</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>故障注入</strong>（Fault Injection）用于混沌工程测试。Istio 支持注入延迟（模拟网络慢）和中止（模拟服务故障），验证服务在故障场景下的韧性。通过 VirtualService 的 <code>fault</code> 字段配置，可以对特定比例的请求注入固定延迟或 HTTP 错误响应。</p>\n<p><strong>超时与重试</strong>策略在 VirtualService 中统一配置，避免了在每个服务代码中重复实现。Istio 的重试策略支持配置重试条件（5xx、connect-failure、refused-stream）、重试次数和退避间隔。关键原则是：只对幂等操作配置自动重试，非幂等操作（如支付）应在应用层处理重试逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全策略\">安全策略</h2><p>Istio 提供了零信任安全模型的基础设施实现。所有服务间通信默认使用 mTLS（双向 TLS）加密，每个服务都拥有由 Citadel 签发的 x509 证书作为身份标识。</p>\n<p><strong>PeerAuthentication</strong> 策略控制 mTLS 模式。STRICT 模式要求所有入站连接必须使用 mTLS，PERMISSIVE 模式同时接受明文和 mTLS 连接（用于迁移阶段），DISABLE 模式关闭 mTLS。</p>\n<p><strong>AuthorizationPolicy</strong> 实现细粒度的访问控制。基于来源身份（命名空间、服务账户）、请求属性（路径、方法、Header）和条件组合来决定是否允许请求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: security.istio.io/v1beta1&#10;kind: AuthorizationPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: product-service-policy&#10;  namespace: production&#10;spec:&#10;  selector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: product-service&#10;  rules:&#10;    - from:&#10;        - source:&#10;            principals: [&#39;cluster.local/ns/production/sa/order-service&#39;]&#10;            namespaces: [&#39;production&#39;]&#10;      to:&#10;        - operation:&#10;            methods: [&#39;GET&#39;, &#39;POST&#39;]&#10;            paths: [&#39;/api/products/*&#39;]&#10;      when:&#10;        - key: request.headers[x-api-version]&#10;          values: [&#39;v2&#39;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">security.istio.io/v1beta1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">AuthorizationPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">product-service-policy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">product-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            principals</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cluster.local/ns/production/sa/order-service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            namespaces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'production'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">operation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            methods</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GET'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/products/*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      when</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">request.headers[x-api-version]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'v2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>JWT 验证</strong>通过 RequestAuthentication 资源实现，Istio 可以验证入站请求的 JWT 令牌，与 AuthorizationPolicy 组合使用来实现基于用户身份的访问控制——Envoy 在应用代码之前完成令牌验证，应用只需信任经过验证的请求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能优化与资源管理\">性能优化与资源管理</h2><p>Istio 的 Sidecar 代理引入了额外的网络跳转和资源消耗，需要针对性优化。</p>\n<p><strong>Sidecar 资源配置</strong>：默认情况下 Envoy Sidecar 监听网格中所有服务的配置，这在大规模集群中会造成巨大的内存开销。通过 Sidecar CRD 限制 Envoy 只关注实际需要通信的服务，可以将内存消耗降低 50-80%。</p>\n<p><strong>性能影响量化</strong>：Istio 官方基准测试显示，Sidecar 代理增加的 P50 延迟约 0.5ms，P99 延迟约 2-3ms。对于大多数 HTTP/gRPC 服务（响应时间 10-100ms），这一开销可以接受。但对于超低延迟场景（&lt;1ms 要求），需要评估是否适用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化项</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Sidecar 资源</td>\n<td>设置 CPU/Memory limits</td>\n<td>避免资源争抢</td>\n<td>所有场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置范围</td>\n<td>Sidecar CRD 限制 egress</td>\n<td>内存降低 50-80%</td>\n<td>大规模集群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协议检测</td>\n<td>明确声明端口协议</td>\n<td>减少嗅探开销</td>\n<td>高吞吐服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ambient 模式</td>\n<td>无 Sidecar 的网格模式</td>\n<td>零 Sidecar 开销</td>\n<td>Istio 1.18+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Waypoint Proxy</td>\n<td>L7 按需代理</td>\n<td>精细化资源分配</td>\n<td>Ambient 模式下</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Ambient Mesh</strong> 是 Istio 的下一代架构（Istio 1.18+），取消了 Sidecar 模式。它通过节点级的 ztunnel 代理处理 L4 流量（mTLS + 基础路由），按需部署 Waypoint Proxy 处理 L7 流量（高级路由、认证）。Ambient 模式将资源开销降低约 90%，部署复杂度也大幅简化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Istio 通过 Envoy Sidecar 在不修改应用代码的前提下提供流量管理、安全和可观测性，istiod 统一了控制平面组件</li>\n<li>VirtualService + DestinationRule 是流量管理的核心抽象，支持金丝雀发布、故障注入、超时重试等场景</li>\n<li>mTLS 默认加密所有服务间通信，AuthorizationPolicy 实现基于身份和属性的细粒度访问控制</li>\n<li>Sidecar CRD 限制配置范围可将内存降低 50-80%，Sidecar 增加的 P99 延迟约 2-3ms</li>\n<li>Ambient Mesh 取消 Sidecar 架构，通过 ztunnel + Waypoint Proxy 将资源开销降低约 90%</li>\n<li>只对幂等操作配置自动重试，非幂等操作的重试逻辑应在应用层处理</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Istio 服务网格实践","id":"istio-服务网格实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"流量管理","id":"流量管理"},{"level":2,"text":"安全策略","id":"安全策略"},{"level":2,"text":"性能优化与资源管理","id":"性能优化与资源管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"服务网格可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh/mesh-observability"},"next":{"title":"服务发现与负载均衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh/service-discovery-lb"}}